      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Bamboo man-made board mainly includes: bamboo mat plywood, bamboo curtain plywood, bamboo plywood, bamboo laminated board, bamboo scrap board and bamboo composite board, etc. The main production process of bamboo man-made board is: preparation of constituent units → drying of constituent units → gluing of constituent units → blanking and hot pressing.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "竹人造板主要包括：竹凉席胶合板、竹帘胶合板、竹胶合板、竹集成板、竹废料板和竹复合板等。竹人造板的主要生产工艺为：制备组成单元→干燥组成单元→粘合组成单元→冲压和热压。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
